the european union is a leader in  climate action how can we make the best  use of our leadership in the green  transition maintaining this leadership  would strengthen the competitiveness of  the european union's economy in the  future foresight helps policymakers to  make the most out of the green  transition by anticipating which  technologies are relevant for tomorrow  the core of the open strategic autonomy  is to become more autonomous and to  shape the world's future together with  partners  open strategic autonomy is an emerging  and cross-cutting issue that touches  many fields  how can the european union achieve that  in collaboration with over a hundred  experts we completed a comprehensive  foresight process  four different foresight scenarios on  the european union's global standing in  2040 highlight the uncertainties that  policymakers need to consider for the  future of the european union  the insights we gained help to future  proof european union policies we want  them to stand the test of time and  respond to the challenges of tomorrow  this work supported the commission's  2021 strategic foresight report learn  more about the challenges and  opportunities for the future of the  european union's open strategic autonomy  by reading the scientific report on our  website  you
 

